+; RUN: llc -mtriple=x86_64 -mcpu=raptorlake -verify-machineinstrs < %s | FileCheck %s
+;
+; An OR must not be passed to the AND-only i8 ANDN combine. Besides asserting
+; with assertions enabled, doing so can replace (~a | b) with (~a & b).
